sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EX as Exchange WSS
    participant AD as Go ProviderAdapter
    participant MS as Go MarketService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PY as Python RealtimeAnalysis
    participant RT as Python StrategyRuntime
    participant IN as Go Internal Event Ingress
    participant HUB as Go Public WS Hub
    participant UI as Matching Chart Panel

    EX->>AD: raw kline update + bookTicker/BBO update
    AD->>AD: validate sequence, symbol, timestamp, decimals
    AD->>MS: Normalized KlineUpdate / BBOUpdate

    par Price rendering path
        MS->>HUB: presentation MarketDelta(provider,symbol,timeframe,seq)
        HUB->>UI: only matching subscription key
    and Durable market path
        MS->>DB: batch UPSERT candles + APPEND bbo_events
        MS->>DB: update stream_checkpoint(last_seq,last_closed_at)
    and Strategy path — no Python→Go porting
        MS->>PY: internal WS MarketEvent (normalized schema v2)
        PY->>RT: analyze same StrategySpec used by backtest
        RT-->>PY: Signal(action, confidence, evidence, strategy_version)
        PY->>DB: persist realtime_signal + strategy/data version
        PY->>IN: signed SignalUpdated (retry/backoff, idempotency_key)
        IN->>HUB: normalized overlay/signal frame
        HUB->>UI: signal/overlay delta
    end

    Note over AD,RT: Go sở hữu connection + normalization.<br/>Python sở hữu strategy semantics.<br/>Không generate hay port Go strategy bằng LLM.

